The definedness fact is now exposed, and execution reaches the membership test. The next residual is purely equational: the backend will not normalize one-character substring membership against the fixed ten-vowel literal when the character code is symbolic. I’m adding the finite, exact expansion of that existing semantic function into ten integer equalities; it reads or changes no operational cell.
