codex
The arithmetic predicate itself was left as a symbolic Boolean term, which this backend does not constructor-split reliably. I’m orienting the same exact vowel definition as two disjoint, exhaustive guarded equations returning literal `true` or `false`; this is a total definitional case split, not a new assumption.
