The auxiliary claims are not being reused soon enough to prevent the same state explosion. Because their bridge-free universal theorems already passed, I’m taking the contract’s permitted next step: isolate those theorems in a bridge-free definition, then add narrowly matched true/false call bridges whose complete configuration and arbitrary continuation exactly match the proved domains.
