codex
That orientation causes symbolic recursion to keep expanding, so I’m removing it. The invariant was also broader than the reachable state: when `found` is false, `result` is always empty. I’m splitting the invariant into reachable `found=true` and `found=false` claims, then using one-step folding lemmas that cannot recursively expand.
